OL,3,GNEWSAFlights in Scotland, Northern
OL,4,AIreland and northern England disrupted
OL,5,Aby air traffic control issue
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights in Scotland, Northern Ireland
OL,8,Fand the north of England are disrupted
OL,9,Fdue to a "technical issue" with air
OL,10,Ftraffic control
OL,12,FNational Air Traffic Services (Nats)
OL,13,Fsays engineers are dealing with the
OL,14,Fissue at the Prestwick Centre
OL,16,F"Airports south of Manchester are
OL,17,Fbroadly unaffected, however flights
OL,18,Fheading north and flights departing
OL,19,FScottish airports are currently subject
OL,20,Fto some delay," Nats adds
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
